---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Payments & Refunds">
  <h1>Payments & refunds</h1>
  <p class="legal-notice">This policy is pending final legal and operational review.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Sender payment</h2>
    <p>The sender pays the agreed carrying amount after a match is confirmed. Khepia holds the payment until delivery is confirmed through the platform flow.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Passenger deposit</h2>
    <p>The passenger places a refundable deposit equal to the declared value of the parcel, plus Khepia's commission. The deposit is returned after the delivery flow completes successfully.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Khepia commission</h2>
    <p>Khepia charges a commission on each transaction, deducted from the carrying amount before passenger payout.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Payment verification</h2>
    <p>Payments are verified by the Khepia team. Contact details do not unlock until payment verification is complete on both sides.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Refund process</h2>
    <p>Refund policies and timelines are pending final operational review. Users should contact support for refund inquiries.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
